0153│自我建构完善理论边界
0154│
0155│Su, L., Ji, Y., Huang, Y., & Wang, X. (2025). Are Tourists Happier When Traveling Together? The Interplay of Self-construal and Companion Presence on Hedonia and Eudaimonia. Journal of Travel Research. https://doi.org/10.1177/00472875251366965
